  "description": "<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:26\"><strong>Hi there,</strong></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:33\">Are you passionate about fashion, home decor, and lifestyle products inspired by lush nature? If so, we're excited to invite you to become an affiliate for Bossa Flora!</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:2\"><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:155\">Bossa Flora is a new brand (born on june 2024) offering a curated collection of fashion, home, and lifestyle products with exclusive designs inspired by the beauty of tropical and Mediterranean nature. Our products are crafted with high-quality materials and attention to detail, making them perfect for those who appreciate unique and stylish pieces.</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:2\"><strong>Product Description:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:54\">Our product line includes a variety of items, such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"15:1-18:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:94\"><strong>Fashion:</strong> Silk scarves, vegan leather bags, tote bags, weekender bags, and bomber jackets</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:46\"><strong>Home Decor:</strong> Art prints and vegan candles</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"17:1-18:0\"><strong>Lifestyle:</strong> Tumblers, suitcases, and more</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:85\">We are constantly expanding our collections and adding new products to our offerings.</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:26\"><strong>Unique Selling Points:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"23:1-24:92\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:123\"><strong>Exclusive Designs:</strong> Our products feature original designs inspired by lush nature, setting us apart from other brands.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:92\"><strong>High-Quality Materials:</strong> We use only the finest materials, such as silk, vegan leather, and sustainable fabrics, to ensure the durability and longevity of our products.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"25:1-26:0\"><strong>Affordable Luxury:</strong> Our products offer exceptional value, combining style and quality at affordable prices.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:18\"><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"29:1-32:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:106\"><strong>Commission:</strong> We offer a generous 10% commission on all sales made through your unique affiliate link.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:169\"><strong>Cookie Duration:</strong> Your affiliate link has a 30-day cookie, meaning you'll earn a commission on any purchase made within 30 days of a customer clicking on your link.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"31:1-32:0\"><strong>Payment Methods:</strong> We offer flexible payment options, including PayPal and bank transfer.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"33:1-33:22\"><strong>Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"35:1-36:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"35:1-36:0\"><strong>Dedicated Support:</strong> Our team is here to assist you with any questions or concerns you may have.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:93\"><strong>Join the Bossa Flora affiliate program today and start earning commissions on your sales!</strong></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"39:1-39:14\"><strong>Sincerely,</strong></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"39:1-39:14\"><strong>Angelica</strong></p>",
